<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/57/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of sections 507e and 507f, “identity information” means any information that identifies or purports to identify a person."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/57/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/57/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/57/eng@/~cl_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/57/eng@> .
