<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/57/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of section 507f, “related person” means, in relation to a person, any person whose safety or well-being would reasonably be expected to be of concern of the first-mentioned person.”."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/57/eng@> .
